00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:51.053
- [Will] Do you like apples?

00:17:52.082 --> 00:17:52.915
- [Clark] Yeah.

00:17:52.915 --> 00:17:54.579
- [Will] Yeah?

00:17:54.579 --> 00:17:55.903
(slaps window)

00:17:55.903 --> 00:17:57.807
Well I got her number.

00:17:57.807 --> 00:17:59.521
How you like them apples?

